Subject: Dispose the per-renderer colour output uniform buffer

Freecut MIT adaptation (FL-107). The existing colour output pipeline owns
a uniform buffer; renderer disposal must release it before GPU teardown.
The renderer lifecycle regression exercises lazy signal allocation and
repeated disposal without changing colour, rendering or public APIs.

